{"addedOn":10,"avgRating":["fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o"],"breadcrumbsHtml":"<a href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117\">OpenEdge Development: ABL Reference</a>\n<span><i class=\"fa fa-angle-right\"></i>\n</span>\n<a href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/ABL-Syntax-Reference.html\">ABL Syntax Reference</a>\n<span><i class=\"fa fa-angle-right\"></i>\n</span>\n<span class=\"active\">PROC-HANDLE function</span>\n","class":"manual","created":1470,"dislikeurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/dislike/310296","html":"<article class=\"hascomments\" data-page=\"bundle:openedge-abl-reference-117/enus/PROC-HANDLE-function.html\" id=\"bundle:openedge-abl-reference-117/enus/PROC-HANDLE-function.html\"><main role=\"main\"><article aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\" class=\"dita\" id=\"PROC-HANDLE-function\" role=\"article\">\n  <h1 class=\"title topictitle1 reference\" id=\"ariaid-title1\">PROC-HANDLE function</h1>\n  \n  <div class=\"body refbody\">\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"PROC-HANDLE-function__section_N10032_N1002F_N10001\">\n      <p class=\"p\">Returns a value in the appropriate data type\n(usually INTEGER) that is a unique identifier for a stored procedure.</p>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"PROC-HANDLE-function__syntax_GC1910V2699948\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d490599e104\">Syntax</h2>\n      \n      <table class=\"table frame-all\" id=\"PROC-HANDLE-function__idGDN2R72674390\"><caption></caption><colgroup><col style=\"width:100%\" /></colgroup><tbody class=\"tbody\">\n            <tr class=\"row rowsep-0\">\n              <td class=\"entry colsep-1 rowsep-1\">\n                <pre class=\"pre codeblock\"><code>PROC-HANDLE</code></pre>\n              </td>\n            </tr>\n          </tbody></table>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"PROC-HANDLE-function__example_GC1910W2699952\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d490599e130\">Example</h2>\n      \n      <p class=\"p\">This\nprocedure runs the stored procedure pcust and writes the procedure handle\nto the variable iHandle. It writes the results of the stored procedure\nidentified by this procedure handle into the ABL-supplied buffer,\nproc-text-buffer, and displays it.</p>\n      <table class=\"table frame-all\" id=\"PROC-HANDLE-function__idGDN2R82674394\"><caption></caption><colgroup><col style=\"width:100%\" /></colgroup><tbody class=\"tbody\">\n            <tr class=\"row rowsep-0\">\n              <td class=\"entry colsep-1 rowsep-1\">\n                <pre class=\"pre codeblock\"><code>DEFINE VARIABLE iHandle AS INTEGER NO-UNDO.\n\nRUN STORED-PROCEDURE pcust iHandle = PROC-HANDLE (10, OUTPUT 0, OUTPUT 0).\nFOR EACH proc-text-buffer WHERE PROC-HANDLE = iHandle:\n  DISPLAY proc-text.\nEND.\nCLOSE STORED-PROCEDURE pcust WHERE PROC-HANDLE = iHandle.</code></pre>\n              </td>\n            </tr>\n          </tbody></table>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"PROC-HANDLE-function__notes_GC1910X2699956\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d490599e159\">Notes</h2>\n      \n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n        <li class=\"li\">Progress Software Corporation recommends\nthat you specify a procedure handle for each stored procedure that\nyou run.</li>\n        <li class=\"li\">You do not have to specify a handle if there is only one active\nstored procedure and you do not include SQL statements in the ABL\napplication. In the case of ORACLE only, the DataServer passes SQL\nstatements to the ORACLE RDBMS and uses the default system handle\nin the process.</li>\n      </ul>\n      <p class=\"p\">For more information on using this function, see the OpenEdge DataServer\n        Guides (<cite class=\"cite\">OpenEdge Data Management: DataServer for Microsoft SQL\n          Server</cite> and <cite class=\"cite\">OpenEdge Data Management: DataServer for\n          Oracle</cite>).</p>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"PROC-HANDLE-function__see-also_GC1910Y2699964\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d490599e183\">See also</h2>\n      \n      <p class=\"p\">\n        <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"CLOSE-STORED-PROCEDURE-statement.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/CLOSE-STORED-PROCEDURE-statement.html\">CLOSE STORED-PROCEDURE statement</a>, <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"PROC-STATUS-function.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/PROC-STATUS-function.html\">PROC-STATUS function</a>, <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"RUN-STORED-PROCEDURE-statement.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/RUN-STORED-PROCEDURE-statement.html\">RUN STORED-PROCEDURE statement</a></p>\n    </section>\n  </div>\n<nav role=\"navigation\"><div class=\"familylinks\"><div class=\"previouslink\"><strong>Previous topic:</strong> <a class=\"link\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"PRESELECT-phrase.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/PRESELECT-phrase.html\">PRESELECT phrase</a></div><div class=\"nextlink\"><strong>Next topic:</strong> <a class=\"link\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"PROC-STATUS-function.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/PROC-STATUS-function.html\">PROC-STATUS function</a></div></div></nav><nav class=\"related-links\" role=\"navigation\"></nav></article></main></article>\n","isWatched":false,"labelText":"Product; Product > OpenEdge; Product > OpenEdge > Version 11.7; Format; Format > Documentation","likes":0,"likeurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/like/310296","myDocsURL":null,"numOfPageViews":0,"numOfRatingsText":"<span>0 Ratings","revised":1318,"showWatch":false,"topicMeta":[["bookowner","oe11docs"],["bookrights","oe11docs"],["bundle","openedge-abl-reference-117"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product/product_openedge"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product/product_openedge/product_openedge_117"],["data","OEInformationHub/format"],["data","OEInformationHub/format/format_documentation"],["organization","oe11docs"]],"topicTitle":"PROC-HANDLE function","topicurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/PROC-HANDLE-function.html","type":"Manual"}